{
  "label": "chinamidate20",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label chinamidate20:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I tap on Chinami’s name in my phone and wait for her to answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami hotline! Thank you for calling during happy hour!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s happy hour?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Every hour is happy hour! Life is good! Buy giraffes!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I still haven’t received the first ones I ordered.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry. You need to call our customer support line if you want help with that. This is the giraffe center.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I sigh to myself and wonder for what feels like the millionth time why I’m calling one of my student’s little sisters.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I then hang up and dial the customer support number to follow up on the giraffe situation.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just kidding.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where are you right now, Chinami? It sounds kind of loud.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would you like a hint?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. Why not?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Arf!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, you’re at the mall.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is Chika there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course big sis Chika is there. Did you think Chinami came here all by herself?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...a good point. I’m not really sure why I asked that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well Chinami is glad you did! And she’s also glad you agreed to babysit her!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bye bye, Papa! See you soon!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I slowly shove my phone back into my pocket and begin to head over to the bus station to hang out with a girl in a dog mask.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian1.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Arf!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t imagine it’s very easy to drink that with a dog mask on.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Doggies can’t drink strawberry milk. They’ll get a tummy ache.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you remind me why I spent money on buying you a drink you can not consume?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because you love Chinami.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do not love Chinami.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But you bought her strawberry milk and a cell phone.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that really how kids are judging love nowadays?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami doesn’t know. She’s not old enough to fall in love.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I quickly scan the mall to see how any onlookers might be viewing this...scene.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I immediately find that it’s not very good.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami, is there any way we could get you a less...conspicuous costume for when you come to the mall?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh right. Chinami forgot you hate puppies.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is just kind of weird any way you look at it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay! Chinami understands that it would be normal for you to be seen with a little girl without a helmet on.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’ll call her people and see what they can do.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But in the meantime-",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Arf!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Again, I find myself leaning back in my chair and wondering how my life has gotten to this point.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t have to wonder for very long, though, as I quickly remember that it was my idea to call her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Could I have just left her at the clothing store with her sister? Absolutely.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Would it have been more socially acceptable for me to do that?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Again, absolutely.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Should I stop calling her altogether and begin hanging out with people that I couldn’t go to jail for just looking at?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For a third time, absolutely.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But, no matter how many times I say “absolutely,” I have a hard time believing I’ll ever really figure out how to stay away from this...demon slash CEO slash wizard slash dog.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your eyebrows are being all...eyebrowy again.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am a grown man sitting at a table with a little girl in a dog mask who is holding a box of strawberry milk for sheer aesthetic purposes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Arf!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m glad that you understand.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What...the...fuck...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian2.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, good. Now I’m a grown man sitting at a table with a little girl in a dog mask with aesthetic strawberry milk who has to explain to his students exactly what is happening.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean...yeah?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...Hi, puppy?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Arf!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian3.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please tell me you’re not going to pretend she’s a real puppy.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Otoha, I need you to think about this.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If we just accept and agree that it is a puppy, we can all move on and forget that this ever happened.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like Rin’s idea.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Arf!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian4.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you kidnap her?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? No. What would give you that idea?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The fact that you once made plans with Nodoka and Rin to kidnap me.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey. Noriko was there too.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We all supported yuritopia and she needs to absorb some of the blame for me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian5.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yuri...topia?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahaha! Hahah...Noooo idea what Sensei’s talking about.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s a “yuritopia?”",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian6.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A magical world where all dreams come true.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not all dreams. Just yours.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will Chinami’s dreams come true in yuritopia as well?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You still have several years left to figure that out, Chinami.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami certainly hopes so!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian7.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That name sounds kind of familiar.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Care to join us, Otoha?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And be an accessory to whatever like, fifty felonies you’re committing right now? I'm good.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not doing anything wrong. I’m just babysitting.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Arf!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are teaching wages so bad that you need to pick up a second job just to keep yourself afloat?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They’re not great. That’s definitely true. But I’m doing this job for free.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I'm still good.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where in the world do I know that name from?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin, pull up a seat with your girlfriend and hang out with us. Having two [teenage]girls with me as well as Chinami might somehow make me look...less bad.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian8.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": G-Girlfriend?!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come on, man. Why would you say that?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because it will work. Watch.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian9.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...it doesn’t have to be for long...but...it probably would help Sensei out a little...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You finally summoned up the courage to come here and this is how you want to spend your time?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like I said...it won’t be for long...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian10.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How did you know that was going to work?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Honestly, it would have worked even if I left the girlfriend part out. I just like when Rin gets flustered.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian11.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re a real asshole sometimes, you know that?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one knows that better than me, Otoha.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rin and Otoha grab chairs from a nearby table and join us at ours.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Of course, their attention isn’t even slightly focused on me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Instead, it is focused on man’s best friend- a small girl in a dog costume.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamimeetsalesbian12.webp",
      "alt": "chinamimeetsalesbian12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...um...Chinami, right?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Arf!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think that means yes. I used to have a dog.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you...come here often?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin, please don’t flirt with the puppy.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chinamimeetsalesbian13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
